&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryCodigo DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryCodigo :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK 
        WHERE {&TableName}.cod-localid >= c-localid-ini 
          AND {&TableName}.cod-localid <= c-localid-fim
        BY {&TableName}.cod-localid
        INDEXED-REPOSITION.

    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

